00:15:54.240 --> 00:16:00.000
So, a few years ago my creator friends and&nbsp;
I decided to build our own mall — one where&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:00.000 --> 00:16:05.760
our interests are aligned with yours. On&nbsp;
Nebula, our incentives are to design the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:05.760 --> 00:16:09.780
very best experience and produce&nbsp;
the very best content — the end.

00:16:10.620 --> 00:16:17.340
Content like RealLifeLore’s “Modern Conflicts”,&nbsp;
